---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsCreateResultBookmarkApplicationPoliciesItem
---@field id? string|distilled.Null The UUID of the policy
---@field account_id? string|distilled.Null Identifier.
---@field approval_groups? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsCreateResultBookmarkApplicationPoliciesItemApprovalGroupsList|distilled.Null Administrators who can approve a temporary authentication request.
---@field approval_required? boolean|distilled.Null Requires the user to request access from an administrator at the start of each session.
---@field connection_rules? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsCreateResultBookmarkApplicationPoliciesItemConnectionRules|distilled.Null The rules that define how users may connect to targets secured by your application.
---@field created_at? string|distilled.Null
---@field decision? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsCreateResultBookmarkApplicationPoliciesItemDecision|distilled.Null The action Access will take if a user matches this policy. Infrastructure application policies can only use the Allow action.
---@field exclude? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsCreateResultBookmarkApplicationPoliciesItemExcludeList|distilled.Null Rules evaluated with a NOT logical operator. To match the policy, a user cannot meet any of the Exclude rules.
---@field include? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsCreateResultBookmarkApplicationPoliciesItemIncludeList|distilled.Null Rules evaluated with an OR logical operator. A user needs to meet only one of the Include rules.
---@field isolation_required? boolean|distilled.Null Require this application to be served in an isolated browser for users matching this policy. 'Client Web Isolation' must be on for the account in order to use this feature.
---@field mfa_config? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsCreateResultBookmarkApplicationPoliciesItemMfaConfig|distilled.Null Configures multi-factor authentication (MFA) settings.
---@field name? string|distilled.Null The name of the Access policy.
---@field policy_resolution_account_id? string|distilled.Null The account ID used to resolve policy resources and identity for cross-account WARP authentication. The account must be trusted by the account that owns this policy.
---@field precedence? number|distilled.Null The order of execution for this policy. Must be unique for each policy within an app.
---@field purpose_justification_prompt? string|distilled.Null A custom message that will appear on the purpose justification screen.
