---@field options_preflight_bypass? boolean|distilled.Null Allows options preflight requests to bypass Access authentication and go directly to the origin. Cannot turn on if cors_headers is set.
---@field path_cookie_attribute? boolean|distilled.Null Enables cookie paths to scope an application's JWT to the application path. If disabled, the JWT will scope to the hostname by default
---@field policies? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsCreateResultBrowserRDPApplicationPoliciesList|distilled.Null
