---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsGetResultBrowserSSHApplication
---@field domain string The primary hostname and path secured by Access. This domain will be displayed if the app is visible in the App Launcher.
---@field type cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsGetResultBrowserSSHApplicationType The application type.
---@field id? string|distilled.Null UUID.
---@field allow_authenticate_via_warp? boolean|distilled.Null When set to true, users can authenticate to this application using their WARP session. When set to false this application will always require direct IdP authentication. This setting always overrides the organization setting for WARP authentication.
---@field allow_iframe? boolean|distilled.Null Enables loading application content in an iFrame.
---@field allowed_idps? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsGetResultBrowserSSHApplicationAllowedIdpsList|distilled.Null The identity providers your users can select when connecting to this application. Defaults to all IdPs configured in your account.
---@field app_launcher_visible? boolean|distilled.Null Displays the application in the App Launcher.
---@field aud? string|distilled.Null Audience tag.
---@field auto_redirect_to_identity? boolean|distilled.Null When set to `true`, users skip the identity provider selection step during login. You must specify only one identity provider in allowed_idps.
---@field cors_headers? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsGetResultBrowserSSHApplicationCorsHeaders|distilled.Null
---@field custom_deny_message? string|distilled.Null The custom error message shown to a user when they are denied access to the application.
---@field custom_deny_url? string|distilled.Null The custom URL a user is redirected to when they are denied access to the application when failing identity-based rules.
---@field custom_non_identity_deny_url? string|distilled.Null The custom URL a user is redirected to when they are denied access to the application when failing non-identity rules.
---@field custom_pages? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsGetResultBrowserSSHApplicationCustomPagesList|distilled.Null The custom pages that will be displayed when applicable for this application
---@field destinations? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsGetResultBrowserSSHApplicationDestinationsList|distilled.Null List of destinations secured by Access. This supersedes `self_hosted_domains` to allow for more flexibility in defining different types of domains. If `destinations` are provided, then `self_hosted_domains` will be ignored.
---@field eager_redirect_cookie_setting? boolean|distilled.Null Preemptively sets the Access session cookie on every hostname in a multi-hostname self-hosted application during the initial redirect chain, rather than setting it lazily on first visit. Defaults to true. Set to false to disable the eager redirect cookie behavior.
---@field enable_binding_cookie? boolean|distilled.Null Enables the binding cookie, which increases security against compromised authorization tokens and CSRF attacks.
---@field http_only_cookie_attribute? boolean|distilled.Null Enables the HttpOnly cookie attribute, which increases security against XSS attacks.
---@field logo_url? string|distilled.Null The image URL for the logo shown in the App Launcher dashboard.
---@field mfa_config? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsGetResultBrowserSSHApplicationMfaConfig|distilled.Null Configures multi-factor authentication (MFA) settings.
---@field name? string|distilled.Null The name of the application.
---@field oauth_configuration? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsGetResultBrowserSSHApplicationOauthConfiguration|distilled.Null Beta: Optional configuration for managing an OAuth authorization flow controlled by Access. When set, Access will act as the OAuth authorization server for this application. Only compatible with OAuth clients that support [RFC 8707](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8707) (Resource Indicators for OAuth 2.0). This feature is currently in beta.
---@field options_preflight_bypass? boolean|distilled.Null Allows options preflight requests to bypass Access authentication and go directly to the origin. Cannot turn on if cors_headers is set.
---@field path_cookie_attribute? boolean|distilled.Null Enables cookie paths to scope an application's JWT to the application path. If disabled, the JWT will scope to the hostname by default
---@field policies? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsGetResultBrowserSSHApplicationPoliciesList|distilled.Null
---@field read_service_tokens_from_header? string|distilled.Null Allows matching Access Service Tokens passed HTTP in a single header with this name. This works as an alternative to the (CF-Access-Client-Id, CF-Access-Client-Secret) pair of headers. The header value will be interpreted as a json object similar to: { "cf-access-client-id": "88bf3b6d86161464f6509f7219099e57.access.example.com", "cf-access-client-secret": "bdd31cbc4dec990953e39163fbbb194c93313ca9f0a6e420346af9d326b1d2a5" }
---@field same_site_cookie_attribute? string|distilled.Null Sets the SameSite cookie setting, which provides increased security against CSRF attacks.
---@field scim_config? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsGetResultBrowserSSHApplicationScimConfig|distilled.Null Configuration for provisioning to this application via SCIM. This is currently in closed beta.
---@field self_hosted_domains? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsGetResultBrowserSSHApplicationSelfHostedDomainsList|distilled.Null List of public domains that Access will secure. This field is deprecated in favor of `destinations` and will be supported until November 21, 2025. If `destinations` are provided, then `self_hosted_domains` will be ignored.
---@field service_auth_401_redirect? boolean|distilled.Null Returns a 401 status code when the request is blocked by a Service Auth policy.
---@field session_duration? string|distilled.Null The amount of time that tokens issued for this application will be valid. Must be in the format `300ms` or `2h45m`. Valid time units are: ns, us (or µs), ms, s, m, h.
---@field skip_interstitial? boolean|distilled.Null Enables automatic authentication through cloudflared.
---@field tags? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsGetResultBrowserSSHApplicationTagsList|distilled.Null The tags you want assigned to an application. Tags are used to filter applications in the App Launcher dashboard.
---@field use_clientless_isolation_app_launcher_url? boolean|distilled.Null Determines if users can access this application via a clientless browser isolation URL. This allows users to access private domains without connecting to Gateway. The option requires Clientless Browser Isolation to be set up with policies that allow users of this application.
---@field created_at? string|distilled.Null When the application was created.
---@field updated_at? string|distilled.Null When the application was last updated.

