---@field exclude? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsPoliciesListResultItemCase0ExcludeList|distilled.Null Rules evaluated with a NOT logical operator. To match the policy, a user cannot meet any of the Exclude rules.
---@field include? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsPoliciesListResultItemCase0IncludeList|distilled.Null Rules evaluated with an OR logical operator. A user needs to meet only one of the Include rules.
---@field isolation_required? boolean|distilled.Null Require this application to be served in an isolated browser for users matching this policy. 'Client Web Isolation' must be on for the account in order to use this feature.
