---@field name? string|distilled.Null The name of the Access policy.
---@field policy_resolution_account_id? string|distilled.Null The account ID used to resolve policy resources and identity for cross-account WARP authentication. The account must be trusted by the account that owns this policy.
---@field precedence? number|distilled.Null The order of execution for this policy. Must be unique for each policy within an app.
---@field purpose_justification_prompt? string|distilled.Null A custom message that will appear on the purpose justification screen.
---@field purpose_justification_required? boolean|distilled.Null Require users to enter a justification when they log in to the application.
---@field require? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsPoliciesUpdateResultCase0RequireList|distilled.Null Rules evaluated with an AND logical operator. To match the policy, a user must meet all of the Require rules.
---@field session_duration? string|distilled.Null The amount of time that tokens issued for the application will be valid. Must be in the format `300ms` or `2h45m`. Valid time units are: ns, us (or µs), ms, s, m, h.
