---@field decision cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsPolicyTestsCreateRequestPoliciesItemCase0Decision|string The action Access will take if a user matches this policy. Infrastructure application policies can only use the Allow action.
---@field include cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsPolicyTestsCreateRequestPoliciesItemCase0IncludeList Rules evaluated with an OR logical operator. A user needs to meet only one of the Include rules.
---@field name string The name of the Access policy.
---@field approval_groups? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsPolicyTestsCreateRequestPoliciesItemCase0ApprovalGroupsList Administrators who can approve a temporary authentication request.
---@field approval_required? boolean Requires the user to request access from an administrator at the start of each session.
---@field connection_rules? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsPolicyTestsCreateRequestPoliciesItemCase0ConnectionRules The rules that define how users may connect to targets secured by your application.
---@field exclude? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsPolicyTestsCreateRequestPoliciesItemCase0ExcludeList Rules evaluated with a NOT logical operator. To match the policy, a user cannot meet any of the Exclude rules.
---@field isolation_required? boolean Require this application to be served in an isolated browser for users matching this policy. 'Client Web Isolation' must be on for the account in order to use this feature.
---@field mfa_config? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsPolicyTestsCreateRequestPoliciesItemCase0MfaConfig Configures multi-factor authentication (MFA) settings.
---@field policy_resolution_account_id? string The account ID used to resolve policy resources and identity for cross-account WARP authentication. The account must be trusted by the account that owns this policy.
---@field purpose_justification_prompt? string A custom message that will appear on the purpose justification screen.
---@field purpose_justification_required? boolean Require users to enter a justification when they log in to the application.
---@field require? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsPolicyTestsCreateRequestPoliciesItemCase0RequireList Rules evaluated with an AND logical operator. To match the policy, a user must meet all of the Require rules.
---@field session_duration? string The amount of time that tokens issued for the application will be valid. Must be in the format `300ms` or `2h45m`. Valid time units are: ns, us (or µs), ms, s, m, h.

