---@field id? string|distilled.Null The UUID of the policy
---@field account_id? string|distilled.Null Identifier.
---@field approval_groups? cloudflare.zero_trust.AccessApplicationsUpdateResultBookmarkApplicationPoliciesItemApprovalGroupsList|distilled.Null Administrators who can approve a temporary authentication request.
---@field approval_required? boolean|distilled.Null Requires the user to request access from an administrator at the start of each session.
