---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettings
---@field activity_log? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsActivityLog Specify activity log settings.
---@field antivirus? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsAntivirus Specify anti-virus settings.
---@field block_page? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsBlockPage Specify block page layout settings.
---@field body_scanning? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsBodyScanning Specify the DLP inspection mode.
---@field browser_isolation? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsBrowserIsolation Specify Clientless Browser Isolation settings.
---@field certificate? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsCertificate Specify certificate settings for Gateway TLS interception. If unset, the Cloudflare Root CA handles interception.
---@field custom_certificate? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsCustomCertificate Specify custom certificate settings for BYO-PKI. This field is deprecated; use `certificate` instead.
---@field extended_email_matching? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsExtendedEmailMatching Configures user email settings for firewall policies. When you enable this, the system standardizes email addresses in the identity portion of the rule to match extended email variants in firewall policies. When you disable this setting, the system matches email addresses exactly as you provide them. Enable this setting if your email uses `.` or `+` modifiers.
---@field fips? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsFips Specify FIPS settings.
---@field host_selector? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsHostSelector Enable host selection in egress policies.
---@field inspection? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsInspection Define the proxy inspection mode.
---@field max_ttl_secs? number Account-level cap on DNS response TTLs, in seconds. Gateway rewrites DNS responses so returned record TTLs do not exceed this value. Null means no cap. Each DNS location can inherit, override, or disable it through the location `max_ttl` setting.
---@field protocol_detection? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsProtocolDetection Specify whether to detect protocols from the initial bytes of client traffic.
---@field sandbox? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsSandbox Specify whether to enable the sandbox.
---@field tls_decrypt? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsTlsDecrypt Specify whether to inspect encrypted HTTP traffic.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsActivityLog
---@field enabled? boolean Specify whether to log activity.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsAntivirus
---@field enabled_download_phase? boolean Specify whether to enable anti-virus scanning on downloads.
---@field enabled_upload_phase? boolean Specify whether to enable anti-virus scanning on uploads.
---@field fail_closed? boolean Specify whether to block requests for unscannable files.
---@field notification_settings? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsAntivirusNotificationSettings Configure the message the user's device shows during an antivirus scan.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsAntivirusNotificationSettings
---@field enabled? boolean Specify whether to enable notifications.
---@field include_context? boolean Specify whether to include context information as query parameters.
---@field msg? string Specify the message to show in the notification.
---@field support_url? string Specify a URL that directs users to more information. If unset, the notification opens a block page.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsBlockPage
---@field background_color? string Specify the block page background color in `#rrggbb` format when the mode is customized_block_page.
---@field enabled? boolean Specify whether to enable the custom block page.
---@field footer_text? string Specify the block page footer text when the mode is customized_block_page.
---@field header_text? string Specify the block page header text when the mode is customized_block_page.
---@field include_context? boolean Specify whether to append context to target_uri as query parameters. This applies only when the mode is redirect_uri.
---@field logo_path? string Specify the full URL to the logo file when the mode is customized_block_page.
---@field mailto_address? string Specify the admin email for users to contact when the mode is customized_block_page.
---@field mailto_subject? string Specify the subject line for emails created from the block page when the mode is customized_block_page.
---@field mode? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsBlockPageMode|string Specify whether to redirect users to a Cloudflare-hosted block page or a customer-provided URI.
---@field name? string Specify the block page title when the mode is customized_block_page.
---@field read_only? boolean Indicate that this setting was shared via the Orgs API and read only for the current account.
---@field source_account? string Indicate the account tag of the account that shared this setting.
---@field suppress_footer? boolean Specify whether to suppress detailed information at the bottom of the block page when the mode is customized_block_page.
---@field target_uri? string Specify the URI to redirect users to when the mode is redirect_uri.
---@field version? number Indicate the version number of the setting.

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsBlockPageMode ""|"customized_block_page"|"redirect_uri"

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsBodyScanning
---@field inspection_mode? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsBodyScanningInspectionMode|string Specify the inspection mode as either `deep` or `shallow`.

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsBodyScanningInspectionMode "deep"|"shallow"

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsBrowserIsolation
---@field non_identity_enabled? boolean Specify whether to enable non-identity onramp support for Browser Isolation.
---@field url_browser_isolation_enabled? boolean Specify whether to enable Clientless Browser Isolation.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsCertificate
---@field id string Specify the UUID of the certificate used for interception. Ensure the certificate is available at the edge(previously called 'active'). A nil UUID directs Cloudflare to use the Root CA.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsCustomCertificate
---@field enabled boolean Specify whether to enable a custom certificate authority for signing Gateway traffic.
---@field id? string Specify the UUID of the certificate (ID from MTLS certificate store).
---@field binding_status? string Indicate the internal certificate status.
---@field updated_at? string

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsExtendedEmailMatching
---@field enabled? boolean Specify whether to match all variants of user emails (with + or . modifiers) used as criteria in Firewall policies.
---@field read_only? boolean Indicate that this setting was shared via the Orgs API and read only for the current account.
---@field source_account? string Indicate the account tag of the account that shared this setting.
---@field version? number Indicate the version number of the setting.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsFips
---@field tls? boolean Enforce cipher suites and TLS versions compliant with FIPS 140-2.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsHostSelector
---@field enabled? boolean Specify whether to enable filtering via hosts for egress policies.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsInspection
---@field mode? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsInspectionMode|string Define the proxy inspection mode. 1. static: Gateway applies static inspection to HTTP on TCP(80). With TLS decryption on, Gateway inspects HTTPS traffic on TCP(443) and UDP(443). 2. dynamic: Gateway applies protocol detection to inspect HTTP and HTTPS traffic on any port. TLS decryption must remain on to inspect HTTPS traffic.

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsInspectionMode "static"|"dynamic"

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsProtocolDetection
---@field enabled? boolean Specify whether to detect protocols from the initial bytes of client traffic.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsSandbox
---@field enabled? boolean Specify whether to enable the sandbox.
---@field fallback_action? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsSandboxFallbackAction|string Specify the action to take when the system cannot scan the file.

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsSandboxFallbackAction "allow"|"block"

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsEditRequestSettingsTlsDecrypt
---@field enabled? boolean Specify whether to inspect encrypted HTTP traffic.

