---@field logo_path? string|distilled.Null Specify the full URL to the logo file when the mode is customized_block_page.
---@field mailto_address? string|distilled.Null Specify the admin email for users to contact when the mode is customized_block_page.
---@field mailto_subject? string|distilled.Null Specify the subject line for emails created from the block page when the mode is customized_block_page.
---@field mode? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsBlockPageMode|distilled.Null Specify whether to redirect users to a Cloudflare-hosted block page or a customer-provided URI.
---@field name? string|distilled.Null Specify the block page title when the mode is customized_block_page.
---@field read_only? boolean|distilled.Null Indicate that this setting was shared via the Orgs API and read only for the current account.
---@field source_account? string|distilled.Null Indicate the account tag of the account that shared this setting.
---@field suppress_footer? boolean|distilled.Null Specify whether to suppress detailed information at the bottom of the block page when the mode is customized_block_page.
---@field target_uri? string|distilled.Null Specify the URI to redirect users to when the mode is redirect_uri.
---@field version? number|distilled.Null Indicate the version number of the setting.

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsBlockPageMode ""|"customized_block_page"|"redirect_uri"

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsBodyScanning
