---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsBodyScanningInspectionMode "deep"|"shallow"

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsBrowserIsolation
---@field non_identity_enabled? boolean|distilled.Null Specify whether to enable non-identity onramp support for Browser Isolation.
---@field url_browser_isolation_enabled? boolean|distilled.Null Specify whether to enable Clientless Browser Isolation.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsCertificate
---@field id string Specify the UUID of the certificate used for interception. Ensure the certificate is available at the edge(previously called 'active'). A nil UUID directs Cloudflare to use the Root CA.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsCustomCertificate
---@field enabled boolean Specify whether to enable a custom certificate authority for signing Gateway traffic.
---@field id? string|distilled.Null Specify the UUID of the certificate (ID from MTLS certificate store).
