---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsExtendedEmailMatching
---@field enabled? boolean|distilled.Null Specify whether to match all variants of user emails (with + or . modifiers) used as criteria in Firewall policies.
---@field read_only? boolean|distilled.Null Indicate that this setting was shared via the Orgs API and read only for the current account.
---@field source_account? string|distilled.Null Indicate the account tag of the account that shared this setting.
---@field version? number|distilled.Null Indicate the version number of the setting.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsFips
---@field tls? boolean|distilled.Null Enforce cipher suites and TLS versions compliant with FIPS 140-2.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsHostSelector
---@field enabled? boolean|distilled.Null Specify whether to enable filtering via hosts for egress policies.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsInspection
---@field mode? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsInspectionMode|distilled.Null Define the proxy inspection mode. 1. static: Gateway applies static inspection to HTTP on TCP(80). With TLS decryption on, Gateway inspects HTTPS traffic on TCP(443) and UDP(443). 2. dynamic: Gateway applies protocol detection to inspect HTTP and HTTPS traffic on any port. TLS decryption must remain on to inspect HTTPS traffic.

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsInspectionMode "static"|"dynamic"

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsProtocolDetection
---@field enabled? boolean|distilled.Null Specify whether to detect protocols from the initial bytes of client traffic.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayConfigurationsUpdateResponseSettingsSandbox
