---@field ecs_support? boolean|distilled.Null Indicate whether the location must resolve EDNS queries.
---@field endpoints? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayLocationsListResultItemEndpoints|distilled.Null Configure the destination endpoints for this location.
---@field ip? string|distilled.Null Defines the automatically generated IPv6 destination IP assigned to this location. Gateway counts all DNS requests sent to this IP as requests under this location.
---@field ipv4_destination? string|distilled.Null Show the primary destination IPv4 address from the pair identified dns_destination_ips_id. This field read-only.
---@field ipv4_destination_backup? string|distilled.Null Show the backup destination IPv4 address from the pair identified dns_destination_ips_id. This field read-only.
---@field max_ttl? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayLocationsListResultItemMaxTtl|distilled.Null Controls how DNS response TTLs are capped for this location relative to the account `max_ttl_secs` setting. Omitting `max_ttl` on update resets it to `inherit`.
---@field name? string|distilled.Null Specify the location name.
---@field networks? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayLocationsListResultItemNetworksList|distilled.Null Specify the list of network ranges from which requests at this location originate. The list takes effect only if it is non-empty and the IPv4 endpoint is enabled for this location.
---@field updated_at? string|distilled.Null

