---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesListResultItemRuleSettingsBisoAdminControls
---@field copy? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesListResultItemRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsCopy|distilled.Null Configure copy behavior. If set to remote_only, users cannot copy isolated content from the remote browser to the local clipboard. If this field is absent, copying remains enabled. Applies only when version == "v2".
---@field dcp? boolean|distilled.Null Set to false to enable copy-pasting. Only applies when `version == "v1"`.
---@field dd? boolean|distilled.Null Set to false to enable downloading. Only applies when `version == "v1"`.
---@field dk? boolean|distilled.Null Set to false to enable keyboard usage. Only applies when `version == "v1"`.
---@field download? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesListResultItemRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsDownload|distilled.Null Configure download behavior. When set to remote_only, users can view downloads but cannot save them. If this field is absent, downloading remains enabled. Applies only when version == "v2".
---@field dp? boolean|distilled.Null Set to false to enable printing. Only applies when `version == "v1"`.
---@field du? boolean|distilled.Null Set to false to enable uploading. Only applies when `version == "v1"`.
---@field keyboard? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesListResultItemRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsKeyboard|distilled.Null Configure keyboard usage behavior. When set to enable_read_only_actions, only approved browser commands (find, copy, print, zoom, and select-all) may execute; other keyboard input is blocked from reaching the page. Copy and print remain subject to their independent controls. If this field is absent, keyboard usage remains enabled. Applies only when version == "v2". The enable_read_only_actions value requires an explicit version of "v2".
---@field paste? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesListResultItemRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsPaste|distilled.Null Configure paste behavior. If set to remote_only, users cannot paste content from the local clipboard into isolated pages. If this field is absent, pasting remains enabled. Applies only when version == "v2".
---@field printing? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesListResultItemRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsPrinting|distilled.Null Configure print behavior. Default, Printing is enabled. Applies only when version == "v2".
---@field upload? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesListResultItemRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsUpload|distilled.Null Configure upload behavior. If this field is absent, uploading remains enabled. Applies only when version == "v2".
---@field version? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesListResultItemRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsVersion|distilled.Null Indicate which version of the browser isolation controls should apply.
---@field wm_id? string|distilled.Null Specify the watermark ID (UUID) to apply to the isolated browser session. When present, enables watermark rendering in the isolated browser.

