---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestExpiration
---@field expires_at string Show the timestamp when the policy expires and stops applying. The value must follow RFC 3339 and include a UTC offset. The system accepts non-zero offsets but converts them to the equivalent UTC+00:00 value and returns timestamps with a trailing Z. Expiration policies ignore client timezones and expire globally at the specified expires_at time.
---@field duration? number Defines the default duration a policy active in minutes. Must set in order to use the `reset_expiration` endpoint on this rule.
---@field expired? boolean Indicates whether the policy is expired.

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestFiltersItem "http"|"dns"|"l4"|"egress"|"dns_resolver"

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestFiltersList (cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestFiltersItem|string)[]

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettings
---@field add_headers? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsAddHeadersMap Add custom headers to allowed requests as key-value pairs. Use header names as keys that map to arrays of header values. Header values may contain `@{selector.name}` variable references that are interpolated at the edge. Use `@@{` to escape a literal `@{`. A maximum of 20 header operations (add + set + delete) is allowed per policy. Each header name may not exceed 256 bytes and each header value may not exceed 4 KB. Settable only for `http` rules with the action set to `allow`.
---@field allow_child_bypass? boolean Set to enable MSP children to bypass this rule. Only parent MSP accounts can set this. this rule. Settable for all types of rules.
---@field biso_admin_controls? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControls Configure browser isolation behavior. Settable only for `http` rules with the action set to `isolate`.
---@field block_page? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBlockPage Configure custom block page settings. If missing or null, use the account settings. Settable only for `http` rules with the action set to `block`.
---@field block_page_enabled? boolean Enable the custom block page. Settable only for `dns` rules with action `block`.
---@field block_reason? string Explain why the rule blocks the request. The custom block page shows this text (if enabled). Settable only for `dns`, `l4`, and `http` rules when the action set to `block`.
---@field bypass_parent_rule? boolean Set to enable MSP accounts to bypass their parent's rules. Only MSP child accounts can set this. Settable for all types of rules.
---@field check_session? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsCheckSession Configure session check behavior. Settable only for `l4` and `http` rules with the action set to `allow`.
---@field delete_headers? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsDeleteHeadersList Remove headers from allowed requests by name. A maximum of 20 header operations (add + set + delete) is allowed per policy. Each header name may not exceed 256 bytes. Settable only for `http` rules with the action set to `allow`.
---@field dns_resolvers? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsDnsResolvers Configure custom resolvers to route queries that match the resolver policy. Unused with 'resolve_dns_through_cloudflare' or 'resolve_dns_internally' settings. DNS queries get routed to the address closest to their origin. Only valid when a rule's action set to 'resolve'. Settable only for `dns_resolver` rules.
---@field egress? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsEgress Configure how Gateway Proxy traffic egresses. You can enable this setting for rules with Egress actions and filters, or omit it to indicate local egress via WARP IPs. Settable only for `egress` rules.
---@field forensic_copy? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsForensicCopy Configure whether a copy of the HTTP request will be sent to storage when the rule matches.
---@field forward? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsForward Forward matching HTTP requests to a Worker. Required for `http` rules with the action set to `forward`.
---@field ignore_cname_category_matches? boolean Ignore category matches at CNAME domains in a response. When off, evaluate categories in this rule against all CNAME domain categories in the response. Settable only for `dns` and `dns_resolver` rules.
---@field insecure_disable_dnssec_validation? boolean Specify whether to disable DNSSEC validation (for Allow actions) [INSECURE]. Settable only for `dns` rules.
---@field ip_categories? boolean Enable IPs in DNS resolver category blocks. The system blocks only domain name categories unless you enable this setting. Settable only for `dns` and `dns_resolver` rules.
---@field ip_indicator_feeds? boolean Indicates whether to include IPs in DNS resolver indicator feed blocks. Default, indicator feeds block only domain names. Settable only for `dns` and `dns_resolver` rules.
---@field l4override? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsL4override Send matching traffic to the supplied destination IP address and port. Settable only for `l4` rules with the action set to `l4_override`.
---@field notification_settings? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsNotificationSettings Configure a notification to display on the user's device when this rule matched. Settable for all types of rules with the action set to `block`.
---@field override_host? string Defines a hostname for override, for the matching DNS queries. Settable only for `dns` rules with the action set to `override`.
---@field override_ips? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsOverrideIpsList Defines a an IP or set of IPs for overriding matched DNS queries. Settable only for `dns` rules with the action set to `override`.
---@field payload_log? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsPayloadLog Configure DLP payload logging. Settable only for `http` rules.
---@field quarantine? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsQuarantine Configure settings that apply to quarantine rules. Settable only for `http` rules.
---@field redirect? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsRedirect Apply settings to redirect rules. Settable only for `http` rules with the action set to `redirect`.
---@field resolve_dns_internally? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsResolveDnsInternally Configure to forward the query to the internal DNS service, passing the specified 'view_id' as input. Not used when 'dns_resolvers' is specified or 'resolve_dns_through_cloudflare' is set. Only valid when a rule's action set to 'resolve'. Settable only for `dns_resolver` rules.
---@field resolve_dns_through_cloudflare? boolean Enable to send queries that match the policy to Cloudflare's default 1.1.1.1 DNS resolver. Cannot set when 'dns_resolvers' specified or 'resolve_dns_internally' is set. Only valid when a rule's action set to 'resolve'. Settable only for `dns_resolver` rules.
---@field set_headers? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsSetHeadersMap Replace existing headers on allowed requests with the specified key-value pairs. If a header does not exist, it is added. Header values may contain `@{selector.name}` variable references that are interpolated at the edge. Use `@@{` to escape a literal `@{`. A maximum of 20 header operations (add + set + delete) is allowed per policy. Each header name may not exceed 256 bytes and each header value may not exceed 4 KB. Settable only for `http` rules with the action set to `allow`.
---@field untrusted_cert? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsUntrustedCert Configure behavior when an upstream certificate is invalid or an SSL error occurs. Settable only for `http` rules with the action set to `allow`.

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsAddHeadersMap { [string]: cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsAddHeadersValueList }

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsAddHeadersValueList string[]

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControls
---@field copy? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsCopy|string Configure copy behavior. If set to remote_only, users cannot copy isolated content from the remote browser to the local clipboard. If this field is absent, copying remains enabled. Applies only when version == "v2".
---@field dcp? boolean Set to false to enable copy-pasting. Only applies when `version == "v1"`.
---@field dd? boolean Set to false to enable downloading. Only applies when `version == "v1"`.
---@field dk? boolean Set to false to enable keyboard usage. Only applies when `version == "v1"`.
---@field download? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsDownload|string Configure download behavior. When set to remote_only, users can view downloads but cannot save them. If this field is absent, downloading remains enabled. Applies only when version == "v2".
---@field dp? boolean Set to false to enable printing. Only applies when `version == "v1"`.
---@field du? boolean Set to false to enable uploading. Only applies when `version == "v1"`.
---@field keyboard? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsKeyboard|string Configure keyboard usage behavior. When set to enable_read_only_actions, only approved browser commands (find, copy, print, zoom, and select-all) may execute; other keyboard input is blocked from reaching the page. Copy and print remain subject to their independent controls. If this field is absent, keyboard usage remains enabled. Applies only when version == "v2". The enable_read_only_actions value requires an explicit version of "v2".
---@field paste? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsPaste|string Configure paste behavior. If set to remote_only, users cannot paste content from the local clipboard into isolated pages. If this field is absent, pasting remains enabled. Applies only when version == "v2".
---@field printing? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsPrinting|string Configure print behavior. Default, Printing is enabled. Applies only when version == "v2".
---@field upload? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsUpload|string Configure upload behavior. If this field is absent, uploading remains enabled. Applies only when version == "v2".
---@field version? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsVersion|string Indicate which version of the browser isolation controls should apply.
---@field wm_id? string Specify the watermark ID (UUID) to apply to the isolated browser session. When present, enables watermark rendering in the isolated browser.

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsCopy "enabled"|"disabled"|"remote_only"

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsDownload "enabled"|"disabled"|"remote_only"

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsKeyboard "enabled"|"disabled"|"enable_read_only_actions"

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsPaste "enabled"|"disabled"|"remote_only"

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsPrinting "enabled"|"disabled"

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsUpload "enabled"|"disabled"

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayRulesUpdateRequestRuleSettingsBisoAdminControlsVersion "v1"|"v2"

