---@field auto_connect? number The amount of time in seconds to reconnect after having been disabled.
---@field browser_extension_config? cloudflare.zero_trust.DevicesPoliciesCustomEditRequestBrowserExtensionConfig Browser extension proxy settings. Required when profile_type is browser_extension and invalid for WARP profiles.
