---@field tcpKeepAlive? number|distilled.Null The timeout after which a TCP keepalive packet is sent on a connection between Tunnel and the origin server.
---@field tlsTimeout? number|distilled.Null Timeout for completing a TLS handshake to your origin server, if you have chosen to connect Tunnel to an HTTPS server.

