---@field dns64_enabled? boolean Enable DNS64 synthesis for DNS queries matched to this location. When updating a location, omitting this field resets it to false.
---@field ecs_support? boolean Indicate whether the location must resolve EDNS queries.
---@field endpoints? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayLocationsUpdateRequestEndpoints Configure the destination endpoints for this location.
---@field max_ttl? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayLocationsUpdateRequestMaxTtl Controls how DNS response TTLs are capped for this location relative to the account `max_ttl_secs` setting. Omitting `max_ttl` on update resets it to `inherit`.
---@field networks? cloudflare.zero_trust.GatewayLocationsUpdateRequestNetworksList Specify the list of network ranges from which requests at this location originate. The list takes effect only if it is non-empty and the IPv4 endpoint is enabled for this location.

