---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.ValidateCasbPostureFindingTypeRequest
---@field account_id string
---@field applies_to_all_integrations boolean When true, this finding type applies to every current and future integration of the vendor.
---@field asset_class string Asset class this finding type applies to (PascalCase, e.g. GoogleWorkspaceFile)
---@field asset_vendor cloudflare.zero_trust.ValidateCasbPostureFindingTypeRequestAssetVendor|string Canonical vendor enum for the platform whose assets this finding type evaluates.
---@field description string Human-readable description of the finding type. Cannot be empty. Maximum 4096 characters.
---@field expression string Rego expression body for the policy. `package cloudflare.casb.custom` and `import rego.v1` are added automatically. Do not include package or import declarations. This field cannot be changed after creation. Maximum 4096 characters.
---@field name string Human-readable name for the finding type. Maximum 256 characters.
---@field severity cloudflare.zero_trust.ValidateCasbPostureFindingTypeRequestSeverity|string Default severity used when no integration-specific severity override exists.
---@field integration_ids? cloudflare.zero_trust.ValidateCasbPostureFindingTypeRequestIntegrationIdsList Required and non-empty when applies_to_all_integrations is false; omit when it is true.

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.ValidateCasbPostureFindingTypeRequestAssetVendor "ANTHROPIC"|"AWS"|"BITBUCKET"|"BOX"|"CONFLUENCE"|"DROPBOX"|"GITHUB"|"GOOGLE_CLOUD_PLATFORM"|"GOOGLE_WORKSPACE"|"JIRA"|"MICROSOFT"|"OPENAI"|"SALESFORCE"|"SERVICENOW"|"SLACK"|"ZOOM"

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.ValidateCasbPostureFindingTypeRequestIntegrationIdsList string[]

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.ValidateCasbPostureFindingTypeRequestSeverity "Critical"|"High"|"Medium"|"Low"

---Unwrapped `result` payload of the Cloudflare v4 response envelope.
---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.ValidateCasbPostureFindingTypeResponse
---@field errors cloudflare.zero_trust.ValidateCasbPostureFindingTypeResponseErrorsList Every problem found with the candidate, so all of them can be surfaced at once. Empty when `valid` is true. Problems without a location come first, followed by located problems ordered by `line`, then `column`.
---@field valid boolean Whether the candidate finding type would be accepted as-is.

---@class cloudflare.zero_trust.ValidateCasbPostureFindingTypeResponseErrorsItem
---@field detail string Description of the problem.
---@field message string Deprecated: use `detail`.
---@field code? string|distilled.Null Machine-readable identifier for the class of problem, when one is available. Omitted otherwise.
---@field column? number|distilled.Null 1-based column on `line`. Omitted when the problem could not be located in the submitted source.
---@field field? string|distilled.Null Request field the problem belongs to, matching the property names of `ValidateFindingTypeRequest`. Array properties are reported per entry with a zero-based index, for example `integration_ids[0]`. Empty when the problem cannot be attributed to a single submitted field.
---@field line? number|distilled.Null 1-based line in `expression` where the problem was found. Omitted when the problem could not be located in the submitted source.

---@alias cloudflare.zero_trust.ValidateCasbPostureFindingTypeResponseErrorsList cloudflare.zero_trust.ValidateCasbPostureFindingTypeResponseErrorsItem[]

