---List the applications available to an account, both the applications Cloudflare curates and the custom applications the account has defined. Results are paginated. Page with `cursor` so that applications added or removed between requests do not make other results repeat or go missing; `offset` paging can repeat or miss results when the list changes between requests. Use `filter` and `search` to narrow the list, `order_by` to sort it, and `fields` to reduce each result to only the properties you need. Use `lookup` to find complete application names mentioned in a rule sentence, ignoring case. Lookup does not correct misspellings. It ranks matches by relevance and uses the same filters, fields, and pagination as listing. `lookup` cannot be combined with `search`. Invalid UTF-8 or a NUL character (U+0000) in any query parameter name or value returns `400`. The authenticated principal must have access to the account identified by `account_id`.
---
---`GET /accounts/{account_id}/resource-library/applications`
---@param input cloudflare.zero_trust.ListResourceLibraryApplicationsRequest
---@return cloudflare.zero_trust.ListResourceLibraryApplicationsResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:list_resource_library_applications(input) end

